    <profile name="Ammo Runt" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities" hidden="false" id="67a0-f55d-cd37-b199">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Each time this unit shoots, when making to hit rolls, you can re-roll one dice for each ammo runt accompanying it. When rolling to wound this unit, always use the Unit&apos;s Toughness (While it is on the battlefield). The death of a Ammo Runt is ignored for the purposes of morale. If the unit has CHARACTER, then the Ammo Runt is considered to have the CHARACTER keyword for the purposes of shooting attacks.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
