    </profile>
    <profile name="Sawbonez" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities" hidden="false" id="1ec9-14a2-0975-1a37">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">At the end of your Movement phase, this model can attempt surgery on a single friendly INFANTRY or BIKER model within 1&quot; of it. If it does so, roll a D6 to determine if the surgery is successful. On a 1 the surgery fails and the model you were attempting to heal loses a wound. On a 2+ the surgery succeeds and that model regains D3 lost wounds. A model can only be the target of a surgery attempt once per turn.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Grot Orderly" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities" hidden="false" id="65fc-7ec3-f2f5-4781">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Once per battle, you can re-roll the dice when this model is attempting to heal a model using the Sawbonez ability, either when determining if the surgery is successful or when determining the number of lost wounds regained.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Dok&apos;s Tools" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities" hidden="false" id="2ef5-7589-6479-f9e0">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Roll a D6 each time a INFANTRY or BIKER unit loses a wound whilst within 3&quot; of any friendly PAINBOYZ. On a 6, that unit does not lose that wound.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="&apos;Urty Syringe" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="f035-2c0c-af3a-400c">
